@url = http://localhost:8080/api/library
@token = paste-token-here

### Get current user's library

GET {{url}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter library

GET {{url}}?status=PLAYING&genre=Adventure HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add an IGDB game

POST {{url}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "igdbId": 1942,
  "status": "WANT_TO_PLAY",
  "personalRating": null,
  "recommended": null
}

### Update a library entry

PUT {{url}}/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "personalRating": 9,
  "recommended": true
}

### Delete a library entry

DELETE {{url}}/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
